flowchart TD
    Agent[Agent changes Open to Pending] --> Trigger[Royal Tyres status-change Trigger]
    Trigger --> WH[Webhook POST JSON / separate bearer secret]
    WH --> WC[WebhookController route boundary]
    WC --> Schema[Schema validates and normalizes Pending to pending]
    Schema --> Auth[Controller checks bearer authentication]
    Auth --> Service[WebhookService]
    Service --> RR[RequestRepository: lookup by Zendesk ticket ID]
    RR --> Correlate[Check external ID when supplied]
    Correlate --> AR[Update Session-tracked AssetRequest]
    AR --> Audit[AuditRepository stages AuditLog]
    Audit --> DB[(PostgreSQL COMMIT: state plus audit)]
    DB --> API[Local request API]
    API --> View[RequestDetailView polling / Dashboard refresh]
